<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  m17-spring4shell: checklist section 17 (Spring4Shell / CVE-2022-22965).

  This module demonstrates the Spring Data Binding vulnerability that allows
  Remote Code Execution (RCE) through malicious request parameters.

  CVE-2022-22965 affects Spring Framework 5.3.0 - 5.3.17 and 6.0.0 - 6.0.2.
  The vulnerability is triggered when Spring MVC binds user-supplied parameters
  to a model object via DataBinder, allowing an attacker to access arbitrary
  Java classes through the classLoader property.

  This is a DELIBERATELY VULNERABLE educational demo. Never run this in production.
-->
